OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with occasional
OL,6,Flight showers or rain, and some hill
OL,7,Ffog, although the odd brighter spell
OL,8,Fis possible. Gentle winds with near
OL,9,Faverage temperatures.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy this
OL,12,Fevening with a few clear spells,
OL,13,Fthough cloud increasing overnight.
OL,14,FLargely dry through the evening, but
OL,15,Ffurther showers developing later.
OL,16,FChilly with a grass frost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
