OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain or showers moving
OL,7,Fnorth through the day. A strengthening
OL,8,Feasterly breeze, though temperatures
OL,9,Faround normal for the time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,13,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,14,Frain or showers, and a gentle breeze.
OL,15,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,16,Fthe time of year.
